flowchart TD
  Timer[DreyOS hourly user timer] --> Local[Authenticated loopback refresh]
  Local --> Personal[Personal ChatGPT Ads and Stripe]
  Local --> OneBB[1BB ChatGPT Ads, Stripe and PostHog]
  Personal --> Push[Whitelist aggregate daily reports]
  OneBB --> Push
  Push -->|Secret-authenticated POST| Sync[Ads Master reporting sync route]
  Sync --> Meta[Personal Meta read API]
  Sync --> Google[Personal Google read API]
  Sync -->|Secret-authenticated bounded payload| Ingest[Convex HTTP ingest]
  Ingest --> Store[Private business and provider snapshots]
  Store -->|Keep last good data on failure| Store
  Owner[Approved Google owner] --> Auth[Convex Auth]
  Auth --> Query[Owner-authorized business query]
  Store --> Query
  Query --> UI[Overview totals, graphs, freshness and next step]
  UI -->|Separate authenticated review| Growth[DreyOS Growth]
  CSV[Explicit browser-local CSV and demo mode] --> Separate[Separate imported or sample charts]
